Package: sobolMDA
Type: Package
Title: Sobol-MDA variable importance for random forests
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2021-01-22
Author: Clement Benard [cre], Marvin N. Wright [ctb, cph]
Maintainer: Clement Benard <clement.benard5@gmail.com>
Description: ranger implementation of random forests, augmented with the Sobol-MDA: 
        a variable importance measure which provides the proportion of output explained
        variance lost when a given variable is removed from the data. The Sobol-MDA
        fixes the bias of Breiman's MDA when input variables are dependent, and is 
        based on projections of the tree partitions of the forest. 
License: GPL-3
Imports: Rcpp (>= 0.11.2), Matrix
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen
Depends: R (>= 3.1)
Suggests: survival, testthat
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.1.1
URL: https://gitlab.com/drti/sobolmda
BugReports: https://gitlab.com/drti/sobolmda/issues
